+/*
+** Generate bytecode to implement:
+**
+**    ALTER TABLE pSrc ADD [CONSTRAINT pName] CHECK(pExpr)
+**
+** Any "ON CONFLICT" text that occurs after the "CHECK(...)", up
+** until pParse->sLastToken, is included as part of the new constraint.
+*/
